WEBVTT

00:12:57.627 --> 00:13:00.680
S tem sporočate, da si lahko bolj zaupate

00:13:00.680 --> 00:13:03.715
pri soočanju z življenjskimi izzivi,

00:13:03.715 --> 00:13:06.640
in da dobro veste,

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:09.351
da pri tem niste sami.

00:13:09.351 --> 00:13:10.733
Hvala.

00:13:10.733 --> 00:13:20.014
(aplavz)

00:13:20.014 --> 00:13:22.912
Chris Anderson: Res je neverjetno,
kar nam govorite.

00:13:22.912 --> 00:13:27.017
Najbolj pa seveda to, 
da lahko prepričanje o stresu

00:13:27.017 --> 00:13:31.500
naredi takšen učinek
na posameznikovo življenjsko dobo.